OrionLayer open fix 84 — the field list is sent when its content changes
========================================================================

Work order 223 (Data's decision of 8 October 2026: applied on
`orionlayer-local`, bundle in ~/claude/bundles/, nothing online). orion2re on
`orionlayer-local`, on top of open fix 83. Every line under ORION2RE_EXT.

The Extension API sent FIELD_LIST only when the field count, the screen id or
a client's connection changed (ext_api.cpp's tick; open fix 2 added the
connection). A view replaced by another with the same count under the same
id went unseen: the race report for one race (RETURN, the Tech Review's tabs,
its list) and Races' main list for two races are both 17 fields under
screen 6, so after RETURN the client kept the report's list while the game
was back on Races. The tick now serializes the list each pass and sends it
when the bytes differ from the last list sent; the count test stays.

